[229.082127, "o", "Provided proper attribution is provided, Google hereby grants permission to reproduce the tables and figures in this paper solely for use in journalistic or scholarly works.\r\n\r\n# Attention Is All You Need\r\n\r\nAshish Vaswani*\r\nGoogle Brain\r\navaswani@google.com\r\n\r\nNoam Shazeer*\r\nGoogle Brain\r\nnoam@google.com\r\n\r\nNiki Parmar*\r\nGoogle Research\r\nnikip@google.com\r\n"]
